\end{gathered}
\tag{11.1}
$$

All these numbers are rational. Direct comparison with (1.6) gives

$$
p_0-h<p_c-h_p<p_c+h_p<p_0+h,
\qquad p_J\in K\subset\mathcal P.
\tag{11.2}
$$

